// Onboarding (BC-3) internal interface.
//
// Two audiences:
//   * The control plane and console, which read cases and deliver signals.
//   * The workflow worker, which reports activity results back to the engine. Those
//     RPCs are the activity callbacks; they are the reason this service exists as gRPC
//     rather than only as REST.
//
// Every step's result is checkpointed BEFORE the next step begins, resuming replays no
// completed step, an aborted instance runs compensations in strict reverse order, and a
// step that exhausts its retries moves the instance to FAILED with the full error chain
// in the workflow DLQ.

